    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000358",
    "title": "Reuben Roy's temptations",
    "description": "The public-domain text of Reuben Roy's temptations by Eglanton Thorne, preserved across 12 original sections with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 24,
    "tags": [
