    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000362",
    "title": "Gloria Crucis",
    "description": "The public-domain text of Gloria Crucis by J. H. Beibitz, preserved across 1 original section with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 30,
    "tags": [
