    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000366",
    "title": "A Sermon, Delivered Before His Excellency Edward Everett, Governor, His Honor George Hull, Lieutenant Governor, the Honorable Council, and the Legislature of Massachusetts, on the Anniversary Election, January 2, 1839",
    "description": "The public-domain text of A Sermon, Delivered Before His Excellency Edward Everett, Governor, His Honor George Hull, Lieutenant Governor, the Honorable Council, and the Legislature of Massachusetts, on the Anniversary Election, January 2, 1839 by Mark Hopkins, preserved across 1 original section with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 9,
